    "name": "Hilton Kuala Lumpur",
    "detail": "This is a great hotel to stay for a few days relaxing in Kuala Lumpur. The hotel is at KL Sentral which is a really convenient location - you can get the airport express direct to KL Sentral and then walk to the hotel in 5 minutes. The staff are extremely helpful and the hotel is a beautiful and modern design which is very relaxing. Our room was spacious, comfortable and spotless. We did not eat in the hotel as there are too many interesting food options in Kuala Lumpur. Hotel were kind enough to lend me a long HDMI cable so we could watch movies from my PC on the large LCD screen. We got one excellent deal at USD84/night (exclusive of all the taxes) on Agoda. I would definitely stay you again. ",
