    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/jw-marriott-hotel-kuala-lumpur/hotel/kuala-lumpur-my.html",
    "name": "JW Marriott Hotel Kuala Lumpur",
    "detail": "I stayed in JW Marriott KL from 6th to 8th September 2018. The upgraded room given to me was very nice and spacious. This is my 1st time staying at JWM KL and it has been a pleasant stay. Staffs were friendly. Location is excellent, just opposite Pavilion and walking distance to Lot 10 / Bukit Bintang area. Breakfast spread at Shook café was ok. Rooms are renovated recently, so quite new and modern, and spacious. The rooms are great but the pillows is too soft! Worth staying. Way better than The Westin which is next door. If you consider to stay at around Bukit Bintang area, JWM could be the best choice for your stay in Kuala Lumpur. Loving this place. Will definitely come back to JWM everytime we visit Kuala Lumpur. Thank you to Desmond and not forgetting Miss Radhika (Reservation Manager) for your outstanding hospitality. Regards Mariana",
